    "detailed_description": "Your job is to face supernatural entities that are not from our world. Survive against enemies from the spirit underworld and perform banishments to send them back where they belong.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/24ef390b7f2b547c9d0602620b4f3dba.poster.avif?t=1753669641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/24ef390b7f2b547c9d0602620b4f3dba.webm?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/24ef390b7f2b547c9d0602620b4f3dba.mp4?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/a70a39dd6ea1ca4c812485efc00a3c42.avif?t=1753669641\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Single player mode</strong></li></ul>Do all the work alone. But be careful, any mistake will cost a lot.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>2-4 player co-op</strong></li></ul>Join with other players and work together to fight the darkness.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Banish powerful spirits</strong></li></ul>Face enemies and banish the spirits back to where they belong.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Escalating difficulty</strong></li></ul>Enemies will get faster and more aggressive as the game progresses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/9269352119cd50febaea887d4b5189fe.poster.avif?t=1753669641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/9269352119cd50febaea887d4b5189fe.webm?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/9269352119cd50febaea887d4b5189fe.mp4?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/7d86b1604c194b3b9a745af15c273c65.avif?t=1753669641\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Level system</strong></li></ul>Progress through the level system and unlock characters and new guns.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gameplay diversity</strong></li></ul>Each map has its own characteristics and mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Insane mode</strong></li></ul>If you are looking for a challenge, the Insane mode was made for you. Faster, harder, crazier!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Free major updates</strong></li></ul>Chased by Darkness is regularly updated with free content. New maps, variety of enemies and new ways to play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.poster.avif?t=1753669641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.webm?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.mp4?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2>This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.",
