decs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/9269352119cd50febaea887d4b5189fe.mp4?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/7d86b1604c194b3b9a745af15c273c65.avif?t=1753669641\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Level system</strong></li></ul>Progress through the level system and unlock characters and new guns.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gameplay diversity</strong></li></ul>Each map has its own characteristics and mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Insane mode</strong></li></ul>If you are looking for a challenge, the Insane mode was made for you. Faster, harder, crazier!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Free major updates</strong></li></ul>Chased by Darkness is regularly updated with free content. New maps, variety of enemies and new ways to play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.poster.avif?t=1753669641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.webm?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1595710/extras/23e26a379997c8004870bec79b042f61.mp4?t=1753669641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING</h2>This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.",
